---
// Pricing Section for Stream Wizard
// Plans: Pro ($20/mo, 10 hrs recording) and Grow ($40/mo, 20 hrs recording)
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-slate-50/70 border-t border-slate-200/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[450px] bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <span class="badge-pill mb-4">Planes y Precios</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Calidad de Estudio a un <span class="text-gradient">Precio Justo</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg">
        Graba tus podcasts y entrevistas a distancia con pistas aisladas sin compresión. Comienza tu prueba sin compromiso.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto items-stretch">
      
      <!-- PLAN PRO -->
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Pro</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
              Podcasters & Creadores
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">
            Ideal para podcasters individuales y creadores que buscan calidad de audio y video profesional.
          </p>

          <!-- Price -->
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight">$20</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-base">/mes</span>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA Button -->
          <a
            href="https://my.streamwizard.app"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl font-bold text-center text-sm border-2 border-slate-900 text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-900 hover:text-white transition-all block mb-8 cursor-pointer shadow-sm"
          >
            Comenzar Prueba Gratuita
          </a>

          <!-- Feature Highlight Box -->
          <div class="bg-cyan-50/60 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-cyan-100/80 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm font-black text-xs">
              10h
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">10 horas de grabación / mes</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Descarga de pistas separadas en alta fidelidad</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature List -->
          <div class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">
              El plan Pro incluye:
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Video local en ultra alta definición <strong>hasta 4K</strong></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Audio máster sin compresión <strong>WAV a 48kHz</strong></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Pistas multitrack aisladas</strong> por cada participante</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Transcripción automática con IA</strong> (diferenciación por hablante)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Exportación de transcripciones en <strong>.SRT, .VTT y .TXT</strong></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Subida continua a la nube</strong> en segundo plano</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Acceso de invitados con <strong>1 solo clic</strong> (sin descargas)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Sin marcas de agua</strong> en ningún archivo</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>1 Estudio permanente</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs text-slate-400 text-center">
          Grabación local inmune a caídas de internet
        </div>
      </div>


      <!-- PLAN GROW (MOST POPULAR) -->
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl border-2 border-cyan-500 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-500/10 flex flex-col justify-between ring-4 ring-cyan-500/10">
        <!-- Most Popular Ribbon -->
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider py-1.5 px-4 rounded-full shadow-md">
          Más Popular
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 mt-2">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Grow</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-700 bg-cyan-100/70 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-200">
              Productoras & Equipos
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">
            Para shows consolidados, productoras de contenido y equipos con alto volumen de grabación.
          </p>

          <!-- Price -->
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight">$40</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-base">/mes</span>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA Button (Gradient) -->
          <a
            href="https://my.streamwizard.app"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-gradient w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-xl font-bold text-center text-sm shadow-lg block mb-8 cursor-pointer group"
          >
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <span>Comenzar Prueba Gratuita</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </span>
          </a>

          <!-- Feature Highlight Box -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-50 to-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-cyan-200/80 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm font-black text-xs">
              20h
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">20 horas de grabación / mes</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Doble capacidad de descarga de pistas separadas</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature List -->
          <div class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-700 mb-2">
              Todo lo incluido en Pro, más:
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>20 horas de grabación</strong> multitrack mensuales</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Múltiples Estudios (hasta 3)</strong> para gestionar varios shows</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Transcripción con IA con <strong>cola de procesamiento prioritaria</strong></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Retención extendida de grabaciones en la nube (respaldo seguro)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Acceso y descarga de pistas en formato <strong>WAV 48kHz y Video 4K</strong> sin límites de invitados</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Soporte técnico prioritario</strong> por email</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Sala de espera (Green Room) para verificar audio antes de iniciar</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs text-cyan-700 font-semibold text-center">
          ★ Rendimiento y almacenamiento premium para creadores exigentes
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Reassurance footnote -->
    <div class="mt-14 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Prueba sin tarjeta de crédito
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Cancela en cualquier momento
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Sin cargos sorpresa
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
